  "solution": "Xét hình vẽ bên dưới\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ffd57471a87210897718f58fd852dba44f1c697d576c7f17901acc6613fb2edc.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDựng hình bình hành <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>12</mn></msub></semantics></math> là hợp lực của hai lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, áp dụng định lí sin, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, áp dụng 